00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:18.030
So Google has a
transfer service.

00:10:18.030 --> 00:10:21.870
So if you're in GCS
or in another cloud,

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:24.150
you can use our transfer
service to migrate data

00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:28.050
