Focus are good bets for you.

00:10:47.470 --> 00:10:50.890
And then if you're far
away and a lot of data,

00:10:50.890 --> 00:10:52.660
like way off in
right field there,

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:54.160
than Zadara is the place to go.

00:10:58.530 --> 00:11:01.020
I thought I had moved
