00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:37.020
And then it can automatically
do things like deduplication,

00:11:37.020 --> 00:11:40.000
or finding nulls,
and things like that.

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:40.980
So this is a new tool.

00:11:40.980 --> 00:11:42.174
We just launched it today.

00:11:42.174 --> 00:11:43.590
And it can help
clean up your data

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:47.430
